# Performance — Rendering

- **Frame budget**: 16.6 ms (60 FPS) on all target platforms; profile and optimize hot paths.
- **URP**: Use Universal Render Pipeline for cross-platform; GPU instancing for foliage, particles, repeated meshes.
- **LOD**: Use LOD groups for large or distant meshes (creatures, terrain, space objects); see `lod_generation_rules.mdc`.
- **Shaders**: Must compile on DX12, Vulkan, and console; test on all build targets.
